	spec: 'pi-compat-research.md preserves a dated official Pi extension surface assessment, a popularity-evidenced sample of 10–15 applicable packages distinguished from bundles, and a concrete minimal optional Hal adapter recommendation. It maps lifecycle, tools, commands, UI, sessions, providers and runtime constraints to Hal, records evidence and limitations, and separates research conclusions from implementation commitments.',
